    "description": "An application-area setup table (Sales & Receivables Setup, Inventory Setup, and any custom * Setup) holds exactly one record per company. Its primary key is a single Code[10] field named Primary Key, and the row's value is left blank. Nothing else identifies the row — there is only ever one.",
